=== start
Like all kingdoms and empires, {kingdom_name} flourished. But like all kingdoms and empires, the period of peace and progress was soon brought to an end. An end marked by blood-stained stone walls and hushed whispers.

Among those left behind to rebuild in the aftermath were three children, tied by the past but destined for different paths. 

One, by choice, took up the sword. Another, true to their nature, took up the pen. And the last, unwilling yet bound by duty, was forced to take up the crown.

Years later, after a tentative peace had been established and a semblance of normal was restored to {kingdom_name}, a famine threatens to sweep through the whole kingdom while the threat of an usurper looms on the horizon.

There are three main threads in this tapestry, woven together by fate and choice. And now, you must decide which thread to follow. 

